    <description>A sage was born, or a sage has died; either way, the Qilin stands where you stand. Lin Wenshu, the Hoof Without Prints, stopped a war with a single step; at this purity kindness is no longer a bond of the blood but a choice.</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/CVG_RootElement_Earth</iconPath>
